WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:15.160 --> 00:00:16.100
Sup baby?

00:00:16.100 --> 00:00:21.280
This week on Thug Notes we jackin in with
Ready Player One by Ernest Cline.

00:00:23.980 --> 00:00:31.380
It’s da year 2040 and errything f***in sucks-
I’m talkin famine, poverty, an energy crisis

00:00:31.380 --> 00:00:34.580
up the a**, wars- I could go on playa.

00:00:34.580 --> 00:00:39.940
To escape this whacked out world, errybody
live in a VR game called the OASIS.

00:00:39.940 --> 00:00:46.820
You can do ANYTHING up in here - get yo learn
on, hustle at a job, buy stuff, swang n’

00:00:46.820 --> 00:00:48.100
