00:00:48.540 --> 00:00:54.260
Erryone up on their daily grind when da creator
of the OASIS, a 10 figure balla named James

00:00:54.280 --> 00:01:00.080
Halliday, takes dat long dirt nap and drops
a video message on all the playas.

00:01:00.080 --> 00:01:06.380
Brutha say he hid an easter egg in the OASIS,
and da first cat to nab three keys that unlock

00:01:06.380 --> 00:01:10.040
it gets ALL his fat stacks.

00:01:10.040 --> 00:01:11.260
MONEY!

00:01:11.260 --> 00:01:17.360
For the next five years, homies bustin a**
tryna find dem keys and get on da big-a** scoreboard.

00:01:17.360 --> 00:01:22.300
Deez peeps called “gunters” and they WILD
about the 80s and errything Halliday.

00:01:22.300 --> 00:01:28.880
Ain’t nobody find s*** til our 18 year old
narrator Wade step up and crack the first clue.

00:01:29.060 --> 00:01:29.960
Wooo!

00:01:29.960 --> 00:01:35.380
See- Wade come from the hood so he straight OBSESSED with gettin’ Halliday’s cash monies.

00:01:35.420 --> 00:01:41.100
One day, Wade chillin in latin class when
he recognize the first key might be on this

00:01:41.100 --> 00:01:42.420
here school planet.

00:01:42.420 --> 00:01:48.119
So homeboy teleport to the spot, shakes off
some traps, wrecks shop at a minigame, and

00:01:48.119 --> 00:01:50.619
HELL YEAH- he GIT dat key.

00:01:50.619 --> 00:01:55.630
He try to book it to the next spot when he
runs into a famous hunny named Artemis, who

00:01:55.630 --> 00:01:58.729
Wade been HOT fo since his balls dropped.

00:01:58.729 --> 00:02:03.180
Turns out she’s been tryna’ beat dat minigame
for weeks, but just can’t hack it.

00:02:03.180 --> 00:02:07.260
Wade give her a tip on the low and swangs
over to the next clue.

00:02:07.320 --> 00:02:12.900
Dude beasts through another minigame like a G and opens up the first gate- where he gotta

00:02:12.900 --> 00:02:16.220
play Matthew Broderick in dat 80s movie WarGames.

00:02:16.220 --> 00:02:17.380
That's my s***!

00:02:17.380 --> 00:02:20.400
Afta he done with dat mess, he gets the next
clue.

00:02:20.400 --> 00:02:25.930
Soon enough, Wade got some company on that
scoreboard- Artemis, his homeboy Aech, and

00:02:25.930 --> 00:02:29.440
two bros named Daito and Shoto are on the
come-up.

00:02:29.440 --> 00:02:35.800
Some shysters from a big a** corporation called
IOI start blowin up Wade’s inbox sayin they

00:02:35.800 --> 00:02:37.069
wanna meet him.

00:02:37.069 --> 00:02:42.520
These haters are called Sixers- and the only
thing on their mind is making BANK off The OASIS.

00:02:42.840 --> 00:02:49.500
Wade decide he wanna meet the top dawg, Sorrento,
who offer Wade some mad grands to start playin

00:02:49.510 --> 00:02:50.510
fo their team.

00:02:50.510 --> 00:02:55.190
When Wade say “Naw, brah I’m straight,”
Sorrento say they know where he live and they

00:02:55.190 --> 00:02:56.890
