00:02:56.890 --> 00:03:01.240
Since Wade’s real body in his hideout, he
just shake dat hater off.

00:03:01.240 --> 00:03:06.030
Then BOOM- His auntie’s trailer go up in
smoke, and a buncha innocents get merced.

00:03:06.030 --> 00:03:12.050
Scurred as hell, Wade holler at all his homies,
and when he tell em what went down they all

00:03:12.050 --> 00:03:13.050
wig OUT.

00:03:13.050 --> 00:03:16.770
So Wade skips town and lays low by takin a
new name.

00:03:16.770 --> 00:03:21.800
While he tryin to crack the next clue, The
Sixers try to ice him, and he gets his woo

00:03:21.800 --> 00:03:23.030
on with Artemis.

00:03:23.030 --> 00:03:27.670
But brutha moovin too fast, so Artemis gotta
shut him down.

00:03:27.670 --> 00:03:29.080
Rookie move, Wade.

00:03:29.080 --> 00:03:35.380
A couple months go by and Wade’s doin what
I call the post-breakup hustle: workout, stay

00:03:35.380 --> 00:03:38.340
busy, and buy a sex doll. What else do you need?!

00:03:38.629 --> 00:03:43.420
He ain’t no closer to finding the second
key when outta nowhere- Artemis got it!

00:03:43.430 --> 00:03:48.209
With a lil’ help from Aech, Wade connects
the dots and books it to a planet where he

00:03:48.209 --> 00:03:53.300
go hard at a game of pac-man and wins....
a quarter?

00:03:53.300 --> 00:03:54.560
Da hell is this s***?

00:03:54.560 --> 00:03:58.220
Boy thinkin this is a LITTLE easter egg so
he pockets it.

00:03:58.230 --> 00:04:03.640
Wade slides over to another planet, takes
down a game, and gets that second key!

00:04:03.640 --> 00:04:09.239
S’all good til he get word that the sixers
ghosted Daito in real life.

00:04:09.239 --> 00:04:10.239
Mmmmmaaannn.

00:04:10.239 --> 00:04:11.680
Dat ain’t good, yo.

00:04:11.680 --> 00:04:17.510
Soon, he boosts the third key and rolls over to the spot where the easter egg gonna be.

00:04:17.510 --> 00:04:23.160
But “Oh s***!!!!”- a whole gang of Sixers
is posted up outside the castle.

00:04:23.160 --> 00:04:25.229
So he comes up with a plan.

00:04:25.229 --> 00:04:31.340
Afta gettin GOT the po-lice, Wade hacks into
the IOI to boost some scandalous evidence,

00:04:31.340 --> 00:04:34.380
mess with their shield, and then BLOWS that joint.

00:04:34.390 --> 00:04:40.331
He hit up Artemis, Shoto, and Aech telling
them to BAIL cuz the IOI is lookin’ to OFF

00:04:40.331 --> 00:04:41.810
em in the real world.

00:04:41.810 --> 00:04:47.150
They all meet in a chatroom and conversate
bout how they gonna take down the Sixers.

00:04:47.150 --> 00:04:52.120
They need ALL the other hoods in the OASIS
to crew up with them in this fight, so wade

00:04:52.120 --> 00:04:56.810
send a message to ERRYBODY tellin’ em when
they gonna throw down.

00:04:56.810 --> 00:05:02.340
While they plottin, Hallidays padna Morrow
shows up in the chat room and say he been

00:05:02.340 --> 00:05:03.360
creepin on em.

00:05:03.480 --> 00:05:07.810
He send errybody some swanky planes to haul
em to his crib.

00:05:07.810 --> 00:05:13.620
When they ready to bang out, the shield falls
and a buncha of gunters and sixers start scrappin.

00:05:13.620 --> 00:05:18.050
the Sixers drop a bomb and BOOOOM- ERRYBODY dies.

00:05:18.050 --> 00:05:19.050
Cept Wade!

00:05:19.050 --> 00:05:21.140
Remember that quarter he got?

00:05:21.140 --> 00:05:24.500
Turns out it was an “extra life,” so he
keep hustlin’.

00:05:24.500 --> 00:05:29.450
He wrecks anotha’ game and plays king arthur
in dat movie with the coconuts.

00:05:29.450 --> 00:05:34.050
After bustin through some other challenges,
he finally gets the easter egg.

00:05:34.050 --> 00:05:39.810
Halliday’s character show up and say “Yo-
reality can be raw as hell, but it's da only

00:05:39.810 --> 00:05:43.610
place you can find happiness, cuz reality is real.

00:05:43.610 --> 00:05:45.270
You feel me?”

00:05:45.270 --> 00:05:51.130
Sorrento gets thrown in the clink and Wade
gonna share his phat check with his homies.

00:05:51.130 --> 00:05:55.080
Then Wade and Artemis hook up in the real
world and finally kiss.

00:05:55.080 --> 00:05:56.800
Awww yeah!

00:06:00.460 --> 00:06:05.360
If there’s one thing this book always goin
on about it’s escapin’ from the horrible

00:06:05.360 --> 00:06:06.770
bulls*** in yo life.

00:06:06.770 --> 00:06:12.510
I mean errybody’s lives are so damn s****y
that they all holed up inside a videogame.

00:06:12.510 --> 00:06:17.240
The game don’t just give em a DIFFERENT
world, but one dat let people shine and live

00:06:17.240 --> 00:06:18.380
life on da easy.

00:06:18.380 --> 00:06:23.070
It ain’t just people gettin their marbles
off by losin themselves in another world,

00:06:23.070 --> 00:06:25.780
but also by losin themselves in the past.

00:06:25.780 --> 00:06:31.530
Errybody in this book always geeked up bout the 80s and s***- from PacMan and a Young Matty B-

00:06:31.530 --> 00:06:36.120
no not that one- to Monty Python, but no Run DMC?

00:06:36.120 --> 00:06:37.620
Man that’s some bulls***.

00:06:37.620 --> 00:06:42.190
If yo head always livin in the past, how you
gonna create new ideas, man?

00:06:42.190 --> 00:06:44.820
How you s’posed to fully live?

00:06:44.840 --> 00:06:50.520
Truth is, sometimes by tryna escape one trap,
people actually end up creating another one.

00:07:15.180 --> 00:07:19.320
So is this kinda future technology bangin
or busted?

00:07:19.330 --> 00:07:23.880
Well on the one hand, da the Oasis playas
can get all the dank knowledge they want-

00:07:23.880 --> 00:07:29.069
I’m talkin free information, free schooling,
and da ability to conversate with homies all

00:07:29.069 --> 00:07:30.280
over da world.

00:07:30.280 --> 00:07:36.660
But on the other hand, if you don’t check yo’self, you can end up isolating yoself from any meaningful connections.

00:07:36.760 --> 00:07:40.400
So Is the OASIS a utopia or a dystopia?

00:07:40.410 --> 00:07:43.460
Well to be real, dat answer ain’t so easy.

00:07:43.460 --> 00:07:49.530
The Oasis give po’ strugglin folks access
to education and jobs since there ain’t

00:07:49.530 --> 00:07:50.740
none on the outside.

00:07:50.740 --> 00:07:56.340
But dat ALSO mean that they ignoring all da
mess happenin around them in da real world,

00:07:56.340 --> 00:07:58.880
which only make dat reality rot to s***..

00:07:58.880 --> 00:08:02.570
It’s like there’s a utopia WITHIN a dystopia.

00:08:02.570 --> 00:08:03.570
You feel me?

00:08:03.570 --> 00:08:07.840
In da real world Wade ain’t got no friends,
no benjamins, and no respect.

00:08:07.840 --> 00:08:12.280
But in The Oasis, dude got solid rep, a nice
cashflow, and a loyal crew.

00:08:12.300 --> 00:08:17.480
I mean just check this - One sec Wade jabberin
bout how horrible s*** is:

00:08:25.280 --> 00:08:28.440
Then he start talkin up his life like it’s
all tight and s***:

00:08:45.000 --> 00:08:48.220
So is escape the answer to livin in a jacked
up world?

00:08:48.220 --> 00:08:53.000
Is it better to kick back and live a decent
life in a fake world or be on the struggle

00:08:53.000 --> 00:08:54.000
