00:09:01.790 --> 00:09:04.320
Or maybe f*** it- what’s reality anyway?

00:09:04.320 --> 00:09:08.560
I’m going wherever they got the dankest libraries!

00:09:08.560 --> 00:09:10.560
Peace, y'all!

